in","Date":"c. 1770/1782","Medium":"etching on laid paper","CreditLine":"Gift of Thomas Vogler in memory of his brother Donald J. Vogler","URL":"https://www.nga.gov/artworks/209441","ImageURL":"https://api.nga.gov/iiif/c7887c3f-56b5-446e-967a-817bc620fa08/full/!800,800/0/default.jpg"},{"ObjectID":211601,"Title":"The Seconda Macchina for the Chinea of 1727: Mount Vesuvius","Artist":"Andrea Rossi, after Alessandro Specchi","Date":"1727","Medium":"etching","CreditLine":"Gift of Vincent Buonanno in Honor of Andrew Robison","URL":"https://www.nga.gov/artworks/211601","ImageURL":"https://api.nga.gov/iiif/dcbe4297-f7eb-44bc-a832-b27f5d20cbd9/full/!800,800/0/default.jpg"},{"ObjectID":215381,"Title":"Luther Martin","Artist":"Louis Lemet","Date":"early 19th century","Medium":"mezzotint and engraving in black on wove paper mounted to brown wove paper","CreditLine":"Corcoran Collection (Gift of William Wilson Corcoran)","URL":"https://www.nga.gov/artworks/215381","ImageURL":"https://api.nga.gov/iiif/2c7657a3-9680-4627-9177-2d593bf703cd/full/!800,800/0/default.jpg"},{"ObjectID":224021,"Title":"The Look-Out (The Office of Victor Hugo)","Artist":"Maxime Lalanne","Date":"1864","Medium":"etching and drypoint on beige laid paper","CreditLine":"Gift of Carol and James Goodfriend","URL":"https://www.nga.gov/artworks/224021","ImageURL":"https://api.nga.gov/iiif/c9c138bf-3f0c-43d4-829c-6cd61892f2f0/full/!800,800/0/default.jpg"},{"ObjectID":224561,"Title":"Archetypa studiaque patris Georgii Hoefnagelii [Part 1, Plate 7]","Artist":"Jacob Hoefnagel after Joris Hoefnagel","Date":"published 1592","Medium":"engraving on laid paper","CreditLine":"Gift of Mrs. Lessing J. Rosenwald","URL":"https://www.nga.gov/artworks/224561","ImageURL":"https://api.nga.gov/iiif/52f2892c-1ae6-4fcb-9e28-bcdeda5387ad/full/!800,800/0/default.jpg"},{"ObjectID":225641,"Title":"God Appearing to Noah","Artist":"School of Marcantonio Raimondi, after Marcantonio Raimondi, after Raphael","Date":"c. 1515/1520","Medium":"eng